  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening SSRC Resource Mobilisation capacity &amp; developing a financial sustainability plan.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of the SSRC National Society Development initiative funded through the NLRC-MoFA 2022-2026 partnership and focuses on National Society capacity strengthening. The initiative in South Sudan contains of three components: strengthening the Financial Sustainability of SSRC (this project) and CEA (see PRJ13-192-0008), and PSEA reporting.</narrative>
  </description>
